            <ArticleTitle>Acute abdomen secondary to a Meckel's lipoma.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>W4-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Small bowel intussusception, presenting acutely in adults is an extremely rare event. We present an exceptional case, previously unreported in the English language, of a lipoma within a Meckel's diverticulum giving rise to this clinical scenario.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
